---
title: "Publish one catalog batch"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: queued
  s1: batch collected
  s2: complete
  s3: isolated changes applied
  s4: failed
  s5: validated
  s6: row transaction staged
  s7: rows synced
  s8: row schema checkpointed
  s9: schema persisted
  s10: revision published
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Collect queued requests
  s1 --> s2: Reject batch with no accepted request
  s1 --> s3: Apply isolated request changes
  s3 --> s4: Validation or persistence fails
  s3 --> s5: Validate proposed catalog
  s4 --> s2: Notify failed waiters
  s5 --> s6: Stage changed row image
  s6 --> s4: Validation or persistence fails
  s6 --> s7: Commit and sync rows
  s7 --> s8: Checkpoint changed row schema
  s8 --> s4: Validation or persistence fails
  s8 --> s9: Persist catalog schema
  s9 --> s10: Publish catalog revision
  s10 --> s2: Notify successful waiters
